---
# ROS C++ Style Guide：基于 Google 风格，120 列，大括号独占一行（cpplint 的要求）
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
ColumnLimit: 120
BreakBeforeBraces: Custom
BraceWrapping:
  AfterFunction: true
  AfterClass: true
  AfterStruct: true
  AfterControlStatement: true
  AfterNamespace: true
  BeforeElse: true
  IndentBraces: false
...
